Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.41,0:00:20.02,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.02,0:00:22.20,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making leaf fish.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.60,0:00:29.70,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,You're good.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:32.88,0:00:35.63,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a fish and this is an octopus!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:38.09,0:00:39.71,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It isn't a starfish?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:44.39,0:00:46.06,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.66,0:01:03.68,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I have something for you.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.54,0:01:11.16,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,A book about fish!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.98,0:01:17.92,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a salmon!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:18.19,0:01:19.89,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the one that's slightly salted!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.51,0:01:22.56,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Does she want to eat it?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.73,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin. Look, this is a flounder.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:31.73,0:01:33.06,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,A flounder?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:33.06,0:01:36.44,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It has both eyes on the same side.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.89,0:01:39.70,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, it's true!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.11,0:01:42.62,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Next, this one!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.92,0:01:44.54,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like a pufferfish.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.93,0:01:47.12,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I see it, I see it.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:56.21,0:01:57.63,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:02.47,0:02:04.20,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't cheat.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:05.27,0:02:07.13,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is this cheating?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:07.13,0:02:08.95,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Cutting is cheating.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:11.87,0:02:16.15,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't cheating. It's called "adults' wisdom."
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.08,0:02:29.58,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.01,0:02:32.21,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It got all chewed up!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.83,0:02:39.20,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,There are holes in this acorn!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.20,0:02:40.32,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Holes?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:43.66,0:02:44.99,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it was an insect?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.85,0:02:52.86,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,That also happened to ours.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:53.51,0:02:58.32,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina even got mad when I said she couldn't bring those acorns home anymore.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.60,0:03:00.40,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,So what should I do?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.40,0:03:04.78,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The insects will get out of the acorn and eat the leaves.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.02,0:03:08.61,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,With the leaves? We pressed them.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.06,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Pressed leaves?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:23.32,0:03:24.85,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.16,0:03:27.58,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, wash your hands first!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.09,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a moment!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:02.17,0:04:04.62,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm leaving!
